description.narrative:
Agricultural technologies and services Center (Center) is a business unit-public under An Giang’s Department of Agriculture and rural development. The functions of center shall be as bellows:
- To implement the inspection, testing and accreditation of quality, and organize the supply and service of plant varieties and animal breeds;
- To implement public services of sampling and testing agricultural materials, quality of agro-forestry products, fisheries and salt testing, diagnosing and treating diseases for livestock, poultry, aquatic products and livestock; participate in standard and regulation conformity certification activities in the field of quality of agricultural, forestry, fishery and salt products; provide technical services and professionaltraining on the quality of agricultural materials, food safety, agro-forestry-fishery and salt; vocational training and education in the field of agriculture; provide quality certification, good agricultural practice; organize scientific and technologicalactivities in the field of quality of agricultural materials, food safety of agriculture, forestry, fishery and salt; provide services to promote trade in agriculture, forestry, fishery and salt, agricultural materials in the field, management of the agricultural sector and rural development.
